msgctxt "#30620"
msgid "Sub converter: puts the selected text subtitle at the top of the screen, clear of burned-in subtitles. ASS/SSA keeps its styles, fonts and signs, with the bottom lines moved to the top; SRT and WebVTT become SRT text in the chosen color. Works on any subtitle, whichever setting selected it"
